# Evaluation harness (phase18): run results and any local production-derived
# dataset material must never enter Git. Only explicit smoke/gold fixtures
# under tests/ are committed.
data/eval/results/
data/eval/datasets/

# The generic "datasets/" data-file rule above must not swallow the
# evaluation package source.
!src/evaluation/datasets/

